{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SnowplowEncoding\/documentation\/SnowplowEncoding","doc:\/\/SnowplowEncoding\/documentation\/SnowplowEncoding\/SnowplowBatchEncoder"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/snowplowencoding\/snowplowbatchencoder\/batchlimit"]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:16SnowplowEncoding0A12BatchEncoderV10batchLimit12PropertyJSON0cF0VvpZ","roleHeading":"Type Property","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"batchLimit"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12PropertyJSON10BatchLimitV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"BatchLimit"}],"modules":[{"name":"SnowplowEncoding"}],"title":"batchLimit","symbolKind":"property","remoteSource":{"fileName":"SnowplowBatchEncoder.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/SnowplowEncoding\/SnowplowBatchEncoder.swift#L139"}},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Snowplow’s trackers’ limits on one request, 25 events and 40,000 bytes of body, and an event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of up to 150,000 bytes in a request of its own."}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"batchLimit","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12PropertyJSON10BatchLimitV","identifier":"doc:\/\/PropertyJSON\/documentation\/PropertyJSON\/BatchLimit","text":"BatchLimit","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Snowplow’s mobile trackers send at most 25 events and 40,000 bytes in a request by default,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and an event larger than that in a request of its own. A collector refuses a body over 2 MB"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with 413, and a request larger than its stream takes (192,000 bytes on SQS, 1 MB on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Kinesis, by default) becomes a failed event though the collector answers 200. So an event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of up to 150,000 bytes of JSON is sent alone, within the smallest of those, and a larger one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is left out as "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowEncoding\/documentation\/SnowplowEncoding\/SnowplowEncodingError\/oversized(byteCount:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SnowplowEncoding\/documentation\/SnowplowEncoding\/SnowplowBatchEncoder\/batchLimit"},"references":{"doc://SnowplowEncoding/documentation/SnowplowEncoding":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowEncoding\/documentation\/SnowplowEncoding","title":"SnowplowEncoding","type":"topic","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Send records to a Snowplow collector as self-describing events, whose schemas come from the tracking plan."}],"url":"\/documentation\/snowplowencoding"},"doc://SnowplowEncoding/documentation/SnowplowEncoding/SnowplowBatchEncoder":{"url":"\/documentation\/snowplowencoding\/snowplowbatchencoder","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowEncoding\/documentation\/SnowplowEncoding\/SnowplowBatchEncoder","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SnowplowBatchEncoder","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"SnowplowBatchEncoder","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SnowplowBatchEncoder","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/BatchEncoder","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" of Snowplow’s tracker protocol, so an "},{"code":"HTTPDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can send events to a Snowplow collector’s "},{"code":"POST \/com.snowplowanalytics.snowplow\/tp2","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"self-describing events whose schemas are the tracking plan’s."}]},"doc://PropertyJSON/documentation/PropertyJSON/BatchLimit":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/PropertyJSON\/documentation\/PropertyJSON\/BatchLimit","type":"topic","title":"BatchLimit","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BatchLimit","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"BatchLimit","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The most an ingestion endpoint takes in one request: how many records, how many bytes of body,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and how many bytes of one record’s JSON."}],"url":"\/documentation\/propertyjson\/batchlimit"},"doc://SnowplowEncoding/documentation/SnowplowEncoding/SnowplowEncodingError/oversized(byteCount:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowEncoding\/documentation\/SnowplowEncoding\/SnowplowEncodingError\/oversized(byteCount:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The event’s JSON is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"byteCount"},{"type":"text","text":" bytes, more than the encoder’s limit lets one record hold:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"150,000 bytes by default ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowEncoding\/documentation\/SnowplowEncoding\/SnowplowBatchEncoder\/batchLimit","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"), within the smallest of a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pipeline’s streams. Only "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowEncoding\/documentation\/SnowplowEncoding\/SnowplowBatchEncoder\/requests(for:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" leaves a record out for it."}],"url":"\/documentation\/snowplowencoding\/snowplowencodingerror\/oversized(bytecount:)","title":"SnowplowEncodingError.oversized(byteCount:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"oversized","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"byteCount","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://SnowplowEncoding/documentation/SnowplowEncoding/SnowplowBatchEncoder/requests(for:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"batch"},{"type":"text","text":" as the tracker protocol’s requests, each within the encoder’s limit, with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"records left out of them."}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowEncoding\/documentation\/SnowplowEncoding\/SnowplowBatchEncoder\/requests(for:)","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"requests","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"for","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"EventRecord","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventRecordV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BatchRequests","preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations13BatchRequestsV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"SnowplowEncodingError","preciseIdentifier":"s:16SnowplowEncoding0aB5ErrorO","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/snowplowencoding\/snowplowbatchencoder\/requests(for:)","type":"topic","title":"requests(for:)"},"doc://SnowplowEncoding/documentation/SnowplowEncoding/SnowplowBatchEncoder/batchLimit":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"